title: script:run
tags: [[GUI command]] [[Scripting the GUI]]
kind: reference
summary: Run an installed helper script

Runs one of the scripts installed in `~/.config/metafolder/scripts/`: without an argument it lists those carrying a `# Summary:` line, with their description; with a name — the `.sh` optional — it runs that one. The script gets no argument and asks for what it needs ([[Running shipped scripts]]).
